> f(x: u8) = x
> g(x: u8) = x where x < 256
  note: literal 256 does not fit u8; it becomes 0
> domain g
domain of g:
  x: u8, 0..255
  where x < 0
  no conditions: total on its parameter types
  defined at 0 of 0 points
  over all 0 points of the domain
> equiv f ~ g
f and g are equal on the domain of f (exhaustive)
